house of worship or three on-premise\nliquor establishments.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\nNone.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n2009 Passed Assembly, Senate 3rd Reading\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect December 31, 2010.\n",
